|なんばんせん}ですか。",romaji:"sumimasen, kyouto-yuki no densha wa nanbansen desu ka",en:"Excuse me, which platform is the train to Kyoto?",kind:"phrase",stage:2,topic:"station",formality:"polite",context:"Asking station staff where your train leaves from.",chunks:[["すみません、","excuse me"],["{京都|きょうと}{行|ゆ}きの","Kyoto-bound"],["{電車|でんしゃ}は","the train (topic)"],["{何番線|なんばんせん}","which platform"],["ですか。","is it?"]],grammar:["g_yuki","g_question"],say:"すみません、京都ゆきの電車は何番線ですか。"},{id:"platform_answer",jp:"{3番線|さんばんせん}です。",romaji:"sanbansen desu",en:"It’s platform 3.",kind:"phrase",stage:1,topic:"station",formality:"polite",context:"Staff telling you the platform.",grammar:["g_desu"]},{id:"mamonaku",jp:"まもなく",romaji:"mamonaku",en:"shortly / soon",kind:"word",stage:2,topic:"station",context:"Start of almost every arrival announcement."},{id:"mairimasu",jp:"まいります",romaji:"mairimasu",en:"(the train) is coming — humble/formal",kind:"word",stage:2,topic:"station",formality:"service",context:"Announcements: 電車がまいります = the train is arriving.",note:"A very polite word you will mostly hear in announcements, not use yourself."},{id:"ikitai",jp:"{京都|きょうと}に{行|い}きたいです。",romaji:"kyouto ni ikitai desu",en:"I want to go to Kyoto.",kind:"phrase",stage:2,topic:"station",formality:"polite",context:"Explaining where you are going.",chunks:[["{京都|きょうと}","Kyoto"],["に","to (destination)"],["{行|い}きたいです","want to go"]],grammar:["g_tai"]},{id:"tokyo",jp:"{東京|とうきょう}",romaji:"toukyou",en:"Tokyo",kind:"word",stage:1,topic:"station",context:"Station signs and ticket machines."},{id:"kyoto",jp:"{京都|きょうと}",romaji:"kyouto",en:"Kyoto",kind:"word",stage:1,topic:"station",context:"Station signs and ticket machines."},{id:"osaka",jp:"{大阪|おおさか}",romaji:"oosaka",en:"Osaka",kind:"word",stage:1,topic:"station",context:"Station signs and ticket machines."},{id:"nara",jp:"{奈良|なら}",romaji:"nara",en:"Nara",kind:"word",stage:1,topic:"station",context:"Station signs and ticket machines."},{id:"hiroshima",jp:"{広島|ひろしま}",romaji:"hirosh